<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh March forex reserves slip to $1.79 bln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh March forex reserves slip to $1.79 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange reserves fell to $1.79 billion at the end of March from $1.9 billion in February, central bank officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>Reserves totalled $2.19 billion in March, 1996.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves (in billions of dollars)</p>
<p>    March 97	 February 97    March 96</p>
<p>    1.79	     1.9		2.19</p>
</text>
